# ❌ Mistakes I Made Today

### 1. Typographical Error

I printed:

```
Fight Number
```

Instead of:

```
Flight Number
```

Always verify output messages before finishing your program.

---

### 2. User Input Improvement

Instead of:

```python
favourite_city = input("Enter your favourite city: ")
```

Use:

```python
favourite_city = input("Enter your favourite city: ").strip().title()
```

This removes unwanted spaces and handles capitalization.

